#: backends/mixerbackend.cpp:352
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Controls the volume of the front speakers or all speakers (depending on your "
"soundcard model). If you use a digital output, you might need to also use "
"other controls like ADC or DAC. For headphones, soundcards often supply a "
"Headphone control."
msgstr "Upravlja glasnoćom prednjih ili svih zvučnika, ovisno o modelu zvučne kartice. Ako upotrebljavate digitalni izlaz, možda ćete morati upotrijebiti i druge kontrole kao što su ADC ili DAC. Zvučne kartice često imaju posebnu kontrolu za slušalice."

#: backends/mixerbackend.cpp:353
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Most media, such as MP3s or Videos, are played back using the PCM channel. "
"As such, the playback volume of such media is controlled by both this and "
"the Master or Headphone channels."
msgstr "Većina medija, poput MP3 datoteka ili videozapisa, reproducira se putem kanala PCM. Stoga glasnoćom njihove reprodukcije upravljaju i ovaj kanal i glavni kanal ili kanal slušalica."

#: backends/mixerbackend.cpp:354
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Controls the headphone volume. Some soundcards include a switch that must be "
"manually activated to enable the headphone output."
msgstr "Upravlja glasnoćom slušalica. Neke zvučne kartice imaju prekidač koji treba ručno uključiti kako bi izlaz za slušalice radio."

